[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3455061089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112113#issuecomment-3455061089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112113","id":3455061089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7N8Axh","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-28T07:58:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T07:58:09Z","body":"It seems like `--gpu-profile` is only used in the help, and `--profile-gpu` is used once in the code (changed in this PR).\r\n\r\nSo this PR is correct, but since the (wrongly documented) `--profile-gpu` is actually working currently, I wonder if the better option is to fix the `--help` output?\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ rg --sort=path \"(gpu-profile|profile-gpu)\"\r\nmain/main.cpp\r\n635:    print_help_option(\"--gpu-profile\", \"Show a GPU profile of the tasks that took the most time during frame rendering.\\n\");\r\n1821:           } else if (arg == \"--profile-gpu\") {\r\n\r\nmisc/dist/shell/_godot.zsh-completion\r\n67:  '--gpu-profile[show a GPU profile of the tasks that took the most time during frame rendering]' \\\r\n\r\nmisc/dist/shell/godot.bash-completion\r\n70:--gpu-profile\r\n\r\nmisc/dist/shell/godot.fish\r\n87:complete -c godot -l gpu-profile -d \"Show a GPU profile of the tasks that took the most time during frame rendering\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis was broken in #55703 by @Calinou so it's always been broken basically :D\r\nThe rationale to make the GPU related options start with `--gpu` makes sense to me, so I guess we can go with this. It may break some scripts from users who figured out it's `--profile-gpu` to make it work, so this should likely be documented as compat breaking.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3455061089/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3455170445","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112113#issuecomment-3455170445","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112113","id":3455170445,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7N8beN","user":{"login":"gg-yb","id":76439353,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDM5MzUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76439353?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb","html_url":"https://github.com/gg-yb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gg-yb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-28T08:31:02Z","updated_at":"2025-10-28T08:31:02Z","body":"Another option could be keeping `profile-gpu` too, but marking it as deprecated (possibly in CLI output as well) and removing it later down the line.\r\n\r\nThough I suspect the lack of issues on this topic given the simple cause suggests most people have not used the CLI for this :-)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3455170445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3455426245","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112113#issuecomment-3455426245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112113","id":3455426245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7N9Z7F","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},